	<section_number>55.1-2206</section_number>
	<catch_line>Severability of provisions of time-share instruments</catch_line>
	<text>
		All provisions of the time-share instruments shall be deemed severable, and any unlawful provision of such instrument shall be void.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 55-365; 1981, c. 462; 1985, c. 517, § 55-365.1; 2019, c. 712.</history>
